{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0307-range-sum-query-mutable","title":"LeetCode 307 区域和检索 - 数组可修改","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0307-range-sum-query-mutable","wordCount":889,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-307-区域和检索-数组可修改\">LeetCode 307 区域和检索 - 数组可修改</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个数组 <code>nums</code>，请你完成两类查询：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>更新</strong> 数组 <code>nums</code> 下标对应的值</li>\n<li>求数组 <code>nums</code> 中指定区间内元素的<strong>和</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>实现 <code>NumArray</code> 类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>NumArray(int[] nums)</code> 用整数数组 <code>nums</code> 初始化对象</li>\n<li><code>void update(int index, int val)</code> 将 <code>nums[index]</code> 的值更新为 <code>val</code></li>\n<li><code>int sumRange(int left, int right)</code> 返回数组 <code>nums</code> 中 <code>[left, right]</code> 之间的元素的和</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 3 × 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= index &lt; nums.length</code></li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= left &lt;= right &lt; nums.length</code></li>\n<li>调用 <code>update</code> 和 <code>sumRange</code> 方法次数不超过 <code>3 × 10^4</code> 次</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：&#10;[&quot;NumArray&quot;, &quot;sumRange&quot;, &quot;update&quot;, &quot;sumRange&quot;]&#10;[[[1, 3, 5]], [0, 2], [1, 2], [0, 2]]&#10;输出：[null, 9, null, 8]&#10;&#10;解释：&#10;NumArray numArray = new NumArray([1, 3, 5]);&#10;numArray.sumRange(0, 2); // 返回 1 + 3 + 5 = 9&#10;numArray.update(1, 2);   // nums = [1, 2, 5]&#10;numArray.sumRange(0, 2); // 返回 1 + 2 + 5 = 8\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[\"NumArray\", \"sumRange\", \"update\", \"sumRange\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[[1, 3, 5]], [0, 2], [1, 2], [0, 2]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[null, 9, null, 8]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>NumArray numArray = new NumArray([1, 3, 5]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numArray.sumRange(0, 2); // 返回 1 + 3 + 5 = 9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numArray.update(1, 2);   // nums = [1, 2, 5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>numArray.sumRange(0, 2); // 返回 1 + 2 + 5 = 8</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题考查的是在&quot;单点更新 + 区间查询&quot;场景下的高效数据结构选择。前缀和在更新时需要 O(n)，暴力查询也是 O(n)，都无法同时满足效率要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>为什么前缀和不够好？</strong></p>\n<p>前缀和数组可以 O(1) 查询区间和，但更新一个元素需要 O(n) 重新计算前缀和。在更新和查询都频繁的场景下，需要两者都高效的数据结构。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：树状数组（Binary Indexed Tree / Fenwick Tree）</strong></p>\n<p>树状数组是一种巧妙利用二进制表示的数据结构，支持 O(log n) 的单点更新和前缀和查询。它通过 <code>lowbit(i) = i &amp; (-i)</code> 操作实现了高效的层级管理。</p>\n<p>核心操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>update(i, delta)</code>: 从位置 <code>i</code> 开始，不断加上 <code>lowbit(i)</code> 向上更新</li>\n<li><code>prefixSum(i)</code>: 从位置 <code>i</code> 开始，不断减去 <code>lowbit(i)</code> 向下累加</li>\n</ul>\n<p>区间和 <code>sumRange(l, r) = prefixSum(r) - prefixSum(l - 1)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：线段树（Segment Tree）</strong></p>\n<p>线段树是更通用的区间查询数据结构，每个节点存储一个区间的聚合信息。本题中存储区间和。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>初始化</th>\n<th>更新</th>\n<th>查询</th>\n<th>空间</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前缀和</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树状数组</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线段树</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(4n)</td>\n<td>较难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分块</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(√n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：树状数组（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class NumArray {&#10;  private tree: number[];&#10;  private nums: number[];&#10;  private n: number;&#10;&#10;  constructor(nums: number[]) {&#10;    this.n = nums.length;&#10;    this.nums = [...nums];&#10;    this.tree = new Array(this.n + 1).fill(0);&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; this.n; i++) {&#10;      this.add(i + 1, nums[i]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private lowbit(x: number): number {&#10;    return x &amp; -x;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private add(i: number, delta: number): void {&#10;    while (i &lt;= this.n) {&#10;      this.tree[i] += delta;&#10;      i += this.lowbit(i);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private prefixSum(i: number): number {&#10;    let sum = 0;&#10;    while (i &gt; 0) {&#10;      sum += this.tree[i];&#10;      i -= this.lowbit(i);&#10;    }&#10;    return sum;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  update(index: number, val: number): void {&#10;    const delta = val - this.nums[index];&#10;    this.nums[index] = val;&#10;    this.add(index + 1, delta);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  sumRange(left: number, right: number): number {&#10;    return this.prefixSum(right + 1) - this.prefixSum(left);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NumArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> tree</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.nums </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nums];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</s